<urn:atm:triage:finding/AG19-RBQA-R2-F001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AG19-RBQA-R2-F001" ;
  triage:title "PostSendHookEvent.is_ack / LogicalMessage.is_ack hardcoded false at both production construction sites, breaking Acknowledge-kind hook/nudge template selection" ;
  triage:description "ruthless-boundary-qa (AG19-FIX-1-QA-RECHECK-2, Important, repeatable): PostSendHookEvent.is_ack (and LogicalMessage.is_ack) is hardcoded false at both production construction sites in crates/atm-core/src/send/outcome.rs (build_send_delivery_plan, post_send_messages_from_persistence), even though finalize_send_outcome has request.acknowledges_message_id in scope and could set it correctly. This breaks Acknowledge-kind nudge/hook template selection -- a hidden-behavior regression. Does NOT affect ack-state correctness (verified separately as sound). Repeatable: needs a workspace-wide sweep of PostSendHookEvent/LogicalMessage construction sites for the same hardcoded-false pattern, not just these two." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AG" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "RBQA" ;
  triage:severity "Important" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "workspace-wide sweep of PostSendHookEvent/LogicalMessage construction sites for hardcoded is_ack" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-20T05:11:33Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AG19-RBQA-R2-F001/pAG-s19/1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AG19-RBQA-R2-F001/pAG-s19/2> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s19/ef699b64> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s19/ef699b64> ;
  triage:notes "PARTIAL FIX per AG19-FIX-3-QA-RECHECK-1 (quality-mgr) at d50e7c92, STILL OPEN. Production fix genuine and complete: outcome.rs:54 now derives is_ack = request.acknowledges_message_id.is_some(), threaded into both original call sites; workspace-wide sweep (req-qa + ruthless-boundary-qa, independently) confirms no other hardcoded-false production site exists. Regression-test acceptance criterion NOT met: the existing test (send/tests.rs acknowledgement_send_marks_post_send_delivery_as_acknowledgement) only proves is_ack propagation through the Graft/NonClaude delivery path, which never calls built_in_nudge_template_kind_from_post_send_event (only reachable via local_tmux_post_send). The only test exercising kind-selection with is_ack=true does so in isolation (internal_nudge.rs's built_in_template_kind_selection_covers_six_paths) -- exactly the works-in-isolation gap this finding said would not satisfy closure. Required: a send-pipeline regression test using a roster entry with recipient_pane_id: Some(...) and an acknowledgement request, asserting Acknowledge/AcknowledgeTask nudge-kind selection through the real finalize_send_outcome -> hook::emit_post_send_effects -> built_in_dispatch::build_built_in_dispatch pipeline." .

